                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3249: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Paraguay</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Horn</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-07-27T12:00:00-04:00">July 27,
                        1933—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>79. My 78, July 26, 11 a.m. was in error in stating that the League had approved
                    the suggestion.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Horn</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
